   "text": "the big one: a step down\nraises sat's score on the\nand lowers it on cat",
   "originalText": "the big one: a step down\nraises sat's score on the\nand lowers it on cat",
   "fontSize": 17.0,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 15
  },
  {
   "id": "e134",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1660,
   "width": 876.1,
   "height": 23.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 349786673,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 314120300,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "panel": "softmax"
   },
   "text": "Row 2 by hand:   \u03a3 dA\u2299A = 0.1737(\u22120.9005) + 0.8132(\u22120.1292) + 0.0131(\u22120.3124) = \u22120.2656",
   "originalText": "Row 2 by hand:   \u03a3 dA\u2299A = 0.1737(\u22120.9005) + 0.8132(\u22120.1292) + 0.0131(\u22120.3124) = \u22120.2656",
   "fontSize": 19.0,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
  {
   "id": "e135",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1694,
   "width": 926.4,
   "height": 23.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 426135638,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 861543903,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "panel": "softmax"
   },
   "text": "dA \u2212 \u03a3 = [\u22120.6349   0.1364   \u22120.0468]      \u00d7 A = [\u22120.1103   0.1109   \u22120.0006]    (sums to 0)",
   "originalText": "dA \u2212 \u03a3 = [\u22120.6349   0.1364   \u22120.0468]      \u00d7 A = [\u22120.1103   0.1109   \u22120.0006]    (sums to 0)",
   "fontSize": 19.0,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
  {
   "id": "e136",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1744,
   "width": 992.2,
   "height": 22.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 61597292,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 953951817,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "panel": "softmax"
   },
   "text": "The masked dA cells are not 0 (0.1559, \u22120.2480, \u22120.1445), but A is 0 there, so they multiply to nothing.",
   "originalText": "The masked dA cells are not 0 (0.1559, \u22120.2480, \u22120.1445), but A is 0 there, so they multiply to nothing.",
